WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.958
Hey, can we stay with you?

00:00:00.958 --> 00:00:02.166
The StubHub Center is hosting

00:00:02.166 --> 00:00:03.500
a flipping soccer practice

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.541
Sorry, man, we’re in mourning

00:00:04.541 --> 00:00:06.333
I let down my fantasy teams again!

00:00:06.333 --> 00:00:07.708
Nobody fluffin respects us!

00:00:07.708 --> 00:00:08.833
We’re the GD front-runners

00:00:08.833 --> 00:00:09.916
for an AFC Wild Card!

00:00:09.916 --> 00:00:11.125
Bruh, where are we?

00:00:11.125 --> 00:00:11.541
KIKO!!

00:00:11.541 --> 00:00:12.500
K-K-K-K-KIKO!

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.250
Welcome to the Florida section

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:15.541
of Gridiron Heights!

00:00:18.291 --> 00:00:20.208
How have I never noticed this place?

00:00:20.208 --> 00:00:21.500
Probably because it’s only for

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:22.250
underperforming teams with

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:23.583
with quarterback controversies

00:00:23.583 --> 00:00:24.791
And bath salts!

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:25.541
Let me give you a tour—

00:00:25.541 --> 00:00:26.416
I’ll take it from here

00:00:26.416 --> 00:00:27.791
Since I’m the most Florida person

00:00:27.791 --> 00:00:28.250
you’ll ever meet—

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:28.833
AHHHH!

00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:29.375
And I’m back

00:00:29.375 --> 00:00:30.750
Over here we have our own hospital

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:32.041
Why aren’t we getting better?!

00:00:32.041 --> 00:00:34.333
Guess you need&nbsp;another year to evaluate me!

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:36.125
And that’s where the Jags D practices

00:00:36.125 --> 00:00:37.833
OK, why am I the only one who showed up?

00:00:37.833 --> 00:00:38.666
That’s our house!

00:00:38.666 --> 00:00:39.208
Woah

00:00:39.208 --> 00:00:40.541
We built it in ‘72 and

00:00:40.541 --> 00:00:42.000
have sort of coasted since then

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.333
So where do you guys want to eat?

00:00:43.333 --> 00:00:44.958
P-Rivs, let’s go home

00:00:44.958 --> 00:00:45.625
Stay!

00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:47.083
You can be the Kissimmee Chargers

00:00:47.083 --> 00:00:48.416
and play inside the Medieval Times!

00:00:48.416 --> 00:00:49.375
We need stars here

00:00:49.375 --> 00:00:50.583
We’ve been starting a manatee

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:51.791
at left tackle for years

00:00:51.791 --> 00:00:53.083
L.A. CAN KISS MY TUCKUS!

00:00:53.083 --> 00:00:53.750
I’M STAYING HERE!

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:55.333
But we just signed a thousand-year lease!

00:00:56.708 --> 00:00:58.291
I’M MAKING ANOTHER CULTURE CHANGE

00:00:58.291 --> 00:00:59.083
EVERYONE, OUT

00:00:59.083 --> 00:01:00.000
Yeah, OK, let’s leave

